<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{name}} — Invitation</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&family=Cinzel:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
        }

        @page {
            size: 148mm 210mm;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .page {
            width: 148mm;
            height: 210mm;
            break-after: page;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .page:last-child {
            break-after: auto;
        }

        .page-1 {
            background-color: #2a4a38;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 14mm 12mm;
        }

        .page-1::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 3.5mm;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .page-1__photo {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 68%;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center 20%;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .page-1__fade {
            position: absolute;
            top: 48%;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 22%;
            background: linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                rgba(42, 74, 56, 0) 0%,
                rgba(42, 74, 56, 0.55) 40%,
                #2a4a38 100%
            );
            z-index: 1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .page-1__content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .page-1__hero {
            position: absolute;
            top: 38%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            z-index: 2;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .page-1__heart {
            position: absolute;
            width: 72mm;
            height: 72mm;
            opacity: 0.9;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .page-1__oui {
            position: relative;
            font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive;
            font-size: 42pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-shadow:
                0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9),
                0 0 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55),
                0 0 32px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            white-space: nowrap;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .page-1__intro {
            font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
            font-size: 7.5pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.28em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 5mm;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .page-1__names {
            font-family: "Cinzel", serif;
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 3.5mm;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .page-1__names .amp {
            font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            text-transform: none;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0 0.15em;
            vertical-align: baseline;
        }

        .page-1__invite {
            font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
            font-size: 7pt;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 1.65;
            margin-bottom: 7mm;
            max-width: 95mm;
        }

        .page-1__date {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 5mm;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 105mm;
        }

        .page-1__date-side {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 2.2mm;
        }

        .page-1__date-side .line {
            width: 100%;
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }

        .page-1__date-side span {
            font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.22em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .page-1__date-center {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            line-height: 1;
            min-width: 18mm;
        }

        .page-1__date-day {
            font-family: "Cinzel", serif;
            font-size: 28pt;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }

        .page-1__date-year {
            font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            margin-top: 1.5mm;
        }

        /* —— Page 2 —— */
        .page-2 {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 16mm 16mm 12mm;
        }

        .page-2__watermark {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive;
            font-size: 280pt;
            line-height: 1;
            color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.045);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .page-2__header,
        .page-2__quotes,
        .page-2__footer {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .page-2__title {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .page-2__subtitle {
            font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive;
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-top: 2mm;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .page-2__quotes {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8mm;
            flex: 1;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 6mm 0;
        }

        .page-2__quote {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 95mm;
            padding: 0 6mm;
        }

        .page-2__quote p {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.55;
            letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        }

        .page-2__quote cite {
            display: block;
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-top: 3mm;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .page-2__quote--right {
            padding-right: 8mm;
        }

        .page-2__quote--right::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 1px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-2__quote--right .page-2__dot {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            right: -1.6mm;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 3.2mm;
            height: 3.2mm;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .page-2__quote--left {
            padding-left: 8mm;
        }

        .page-2__quote--left::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 1px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-2__quote--left .page-2__dot {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: -1.6mm;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 3.2mm;
            height: 3.2mm;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .page-2__hearts {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 70mm;
            margin-top: 4mm;
        }

        .page-2__hearts::before,
        .page-2__hearts::after {
            content: "";
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-2__hearts-icons {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.5mm;
            padding: 0 3mm;
        }

        .page-2__hearts-icons svg {
            display: block;
            fill: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-2__hearts-icons svg:nth-child(2) {
            width: 3.2mm;
            height: 3.2mm;
        }

        .page-2__hearts-icons svg:first-child,
        .page-2__hearts-icons svg:last-child {
            width: 2.2mm;
            height: 2.2mm;
        }

        .page-2__footer {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4mm;
        }

        .page-2__closing {
            font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive;
            font-size: 15pt;
            line-height: 1.35;
            max-width: 90mm;
        }

        .page-2__hands {
            width: 14mm;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .page-2__rings {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -6mm;
            right: -8mm;
            width: 48mm;
            height: auto;
            z-index: 1;
            pointer-events: none;
            transform: rotate(-12deg);
        }

        /* —— Page 3 —— */
        .page-3 {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 14mm 12mm 10mm;
        }

        .page-3__watermark {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive;
            font-size: 220pt;
            line-height: 1;
            color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            user-select: none;
            transform: rotate(-8deg);
        }

        .page-3__title {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 20pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.22em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 10mm;
        }

        .page-3__timeline {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            width: 100%;
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8mm;
            padding-left: 2mm;
        }

        /* .page-3__timeline::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 4mm;
            bottom: 8mm;
            left: 18mm;
            width: 1px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
        } */

        .page-3__item {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 16mm 1fr;
            column-gap: 8mm;
            position: relative;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .page-3__icon {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding-top: 1mm;
            width: 16mm;
        }

        .page-3__icon svg {
            width: 11mm;
            height: 11mm;
            display: block;
        }

        .page-3__body {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 4mm;
            text-align: left;
            border-left: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-3__dot {
            position: absolute;
            left: -1.85mm;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 3.5mm;
            height: 3.5mm;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .page-3__event-title {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 1.5mm;
        }

        .page-3__details {
            font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
            font-size: 7pt;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.55;
            letter-spacing: 0.01em;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 95mm;
        }

        .page-3__time {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            margin-top: 3mm;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .page-3__hearts {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            width: 55mm;
            margin-top: 3mm;
        }

        .page-3__hearts::before,
        .page-3__hearts::after {
            content: "";
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-3__hearts-icons {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.2mm;
            padding: 0 2.5mm;
        }

        .page-3__hearts-icons svg {
            display: block;
            fill: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-3__hearts-icons svg:nth-child(2) {
            width: 2.8mm;
            height: 2.8mm;
        }

        .page-3__hearts-icons svg:first-child,
        .page-3__hearts-icons svg:last-child {
            width: 2mm;
            height: 2mm;
        }

        .page-3__names {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.28em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: auto;
            padding-top: 6mm;
        }

        .page-3__names .amp {
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            margin: 0 0.1em;
        }

        .page-3__ring {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -12mm;
            left: -14mm;
            width: 58mm;
            height: auto;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.85;
            filter: blur(0.3px);
            transform: rotate(25deg);
        }

        /* —— Page 4 —— */
        .page-4 {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-4__photo {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center 18%;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .page-4__hero {
            position: absolute;
            top: 38%;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 2;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 10mm;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        }

        .page-4__message {
            font-family: "Great Vibes", cursive;
            font-size: 20pt;
            line-height: 1.25;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .page-4__guest {
            margin-top: 7mm;
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .page-4__guest-name {
            font-weight: 700;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding-bottom: 0.4mm;
            margin-left: 1.5mm;
        }

        .page-4__wave {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 55%;
            z-index: 1;
            display: block;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .page-4__wave path {
            fill: #ffffff;
        }

        .page-4__panel {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 36%;
            z-index: 3;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1px 0.85fr;
            padding: 10mm 10mm 8mm;
            gap: 0;
            background: transparent;
        }

        .page-4__col--left {
            padding-right: 5mm;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .page-4__col--right {
            padding-left: 5mm;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .page-4__divider {
            width: 1px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            align-self: stretch;
            margin: 2mm 0 6mm;
        }

        .page-4__rsvp-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4mm;
            margin-bottom: 3.5mm;
        }

        .page-4__rsvp-title {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .page-4__arrow {
            width: 18mm;
            height: auto;
            margin-top: 1mm;
        }

        .page-4__subtitle {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 2mm;
        }

        .page-4__copy {
            font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
            font-size: 6.2pt;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #222;
        }

        .page-4__btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 2mm;
            margin-top: 5mm;
            background: #111;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
            font-size: 6.5pt;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 2.2mm 4.5mm;
            border-radius: 20mm;
        }

        .page-4__btn svg {
            width: 3.4mm;
            height: 3.4mm;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .page-4__stamp {
            width: 32mm;
            height: 32mm;
            border: 1.2px solid #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3mm;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5mm #fff, inset 0 0 0 1.7mm #1a1a1a;
        }

        .page-4__stamp svg {
            width: 11mm;
            height: 8mm;
            margin-bottom: 1mm;
        }

        .page-4__stamp span {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 6pt;
            line-height: 1.25;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .page-4__table {
            margin-top: 5mm;
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .page-4__table strong {
            font-weight: 700;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #1a1a1a;
            padding: 0 1mm 0.4mm;
            margin-left: 1mm;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page page-1">
        {{#image (lookup photos 0)}}
        <img
            class="page-1__photo"
            src="{{{src}}}"
            alt="Couple de mariés"
        >
        {{/image}}
        <div class="page-1__fade"></div>

        <div class="page-1__hero">
            <svg class="page-1__heart" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <path
                    d="M50 88 C50 88 12 62 12 36 C12 22 22 14 32 14 C40 14 46 19 50 26 C54 19 60 14 68 14 C78 14 88 22 88 36 C88 62 50 88 50 88 Z"
                    stroke="white"
                    stroke-width="0.7"
                    fill="none"
                    opacity="0.85"
                />
            </svg>
            <h1 class="page-1__oui">Grand OUI</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="page-1__content">
            <p class="page-1__intro">Ensemble avec leurs familles</p>
            <h2 class="page-1__names">{{lookup partners 0}} <span class="amp">&</span> {{lookup partners 1}}</h2>
            <p class="page-1__invite">Vous invitent<br>à la célébration de leur mariage</p>

            <div class="page-1__date">
                <div class="page-1__date-side">
                    <div class="line"></div>
                    <span>{{dayOfWeek}}</span>
                    <div class="line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="page-1__date-center">
                    <span class="page-1__date-day">{{day}}</span>
                    <span class="page-1__date-year">{{year}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="page-1__date-side">
                    <div class="line"></div>
                    <span>{{month}}</span>
                    <div class="line"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page page-2">
        <div class="page-2__watermark" aria-hidden="true">2</div>

        <header class="page-2__header">
            <h2 class="page-2__title">L'Amour</h2>
            <p class="page-2__subtitle">Un don de Dieu</p>
        </header>

        <div class="page-2__quotes">
            <blockquote class="page-2__quote page-2__quote--right">
                <span class="page-2__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <p>« Ainsi, ils ne sont plus deux, mais une seule chair. Que l'homme donc ne sépare pas ce que Dieu a uni. »</p>
                <cite>Marc 19:6</cite>
                <div class="page-2__hearts" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="page-2__hearts-icons">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </blockquote>

